the stack is empty, gsp says 0
after three pushes 3
popped 10 20 30
the stack is empty again 0
after pushing a name that holds 10 1
and popping it gives 10
three words are on the stack, gsp says 3
the top of the stack is at 2
$n gives 99
$$$n gives 99
after mov $n, 'A' it is 65
word 0 of the stack is 97
after add $n, 1 it is 98
pop $1 took one word off, 2
two bytes of text were pushed, 4
the last byte is i
grow 10 made the stack 10 words long
and slot 9 is 0
grow -10 took them back, 0
grow -1000 on a stack of three left 0
grow n with n at 2 made it 2
ssp 100 made the stack 100
ssp 0 made it 0
cls made it 0
after a function that cleared its scratch 0
